Third-party components bundled in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The `kernels/` directory contains prebuilt binaries that are NOT part of this
project's own source code and are redistributed here only for convenience. Each
retains its own upstream license:

* kernels/vmlinuz-lts, kernels/vmlinuz-lts.raw
  The Linux kernel. Licensed under GPL-2.0. This is a stock Alpine Linux LTS
  kernel build. Corresponding source is available from the Alpine Linux project
  (https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/aports) and kernel.org.

* kernels/boot/initramfs-lts and the ext4 disk image
  Alpine Linux userspace (busybox, musl, apk-tools, and packaged software).
  Alpine packages are distributed under their respective licenses (mostly MIT,
  BSD, GPL). See https://alpinelinux.org and the package index for details.

* Bundled CPython (in the disk image)
  Python is distributed under the Python Software Foundation License.
  See https://docs.python.org/3/license.html.

